Privacy Notice
--------------

The videos in this example dataset are provided only to demonstrate the
RhinoVLA data format and training pipeline. Where people appear in video, faces
have been anonymized before release.

You may not use this dataset, alone or combined with other data, to identify,
re-identify, profile, track, or otherwise infer the identity of any person
appearing in the videos.

